(2,'🟡',"Tagging and versioning images for ML. Compare latest, semantic version, git SHA and model-version tags, why latest is a trap for rollbacks, why tags are mutable and digests immutable, how to tag one image several ways, and how to tie an image to a model registry version and a training run. Propose a tag scheme for a team that ships a model API weekly and retrains monthly, and show the docker tag and push commands (not executed, no registry here).",GEN),
